// For each department of the current structure and each financial year: the outturn in today's structure, the outturn
// of the lines the releases reported under the department's number, and the machinery of government transfer between
// them. A row exists where any of the three has a value (the Unallocated member U084 has no reported number of its
// own, and the closed departments' lines show under the department that answers for their number).
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    'Department (current structure)'[Department Number],
    "current_structure", [Outturn (current structure)],
    "as_reported", [Outturn (as reported structure)],
    "transfer", [Machinery of Government Transfer]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'Department (current structure)'[Department Number]
